  <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy">Information collected
  </h2>
  <p class="mt-2">The website may collect information submitted through the business enquiry form, including contact, company, location, and requirement details. The company should confirm the final collection scope before launch.
  </p>
  </section>
  <section>
  <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy">How information may be used
  </h2>
  <p class="mt-2">Submitted information is intended only for responding to business enquiries, assessing relevant requirements, and maintaining appropriate correspondence. It should not be used for unrelated purposes without an appropriate basis.
  </p>
  </section>
  <section>
  <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy">Storage and sharing
  </h2>
  <p class="mt-2">The final policy must identify the approved form-delivery provider, retention period, security measures, and any lawful sharing arrangements. No such provider is configured in this website package.
  </p>
  </section>
  <section>
  <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy">Contact and rights
  </h2>
  <p class="mt-2">A verified privacy contact and applicable rights procedure must be added after the company confirms its operating location and legal requirements.
  </p>
  </section>
